    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know you say that but it doesn't feel that way. it feels like there's no way for me to \"take care of myself\" that doesn't involve them working around me or paying for things i shouldn't have to. if i wasn't here, they wouldn't have to worry or sacrifice every little thing for me. wouldn't it be more selfless to just... let them go? to give them their freedom back?",
